## Admission law

For each mandatory control `c`, production-subject standing requires:

`ALIVE(c) = observed ∧ admitted ∧ executed ∧ verified ∧ replay_verified ∧ falsifier_checked ∧ exact_subject ∧ fresh(c) ∧ BLAKE3(evidence) ∧ BLAKE3(receipt)`

A `max_age_hours` value of `0` means the evidence is bound to the exact release/change subject rather than a wall-clock freshness window.

## Certification fence

Internal readiness never promotes itself into SOC 2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, FedRAMP, HIPAA, SOX, GDPR, or another external attestation. Any external claim must carry its own authority, scope, verifier, and receipt.
